   "source": [
    "# Generating All Subarrays\n",
    "\n",
    "Given an array arr[], the task is to generate all the possible subarrays of the given array.\n",
    "\n",
    "*Examples:* \n",
    "\n",
    "``` bash\n",
    "Input: arr[] = [1, 2, 3]\n",
    "Output: [ [1], [1, 2], [2], [1, 2, 3], [2, 3], [3] ]\n",
    "\n",
    "Input: arr[] = [1, 2]\n",
    "Output: [ [1], [1, 2], [2] ]\n",
    "```"
   ]
  }
 ],
